<title>FRANCE: Synthelabo sees 96 margin, sales rise.</title>
<headline>Synthelabo sees 96 margin, sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>French drugs group Synthelabo said on Monday that it expected its net margins to rise in 1996 and also a 10 percent rise in its sales for the year.</p>
<p>The group made the forecast in a statement which showed sales of 7.582 billion for the first nine months, up 10.4 percent.</p>
</text>
